<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<!--
    The app's shared visual vocabulary — the entry point, and nothing else.

    Until this file existed there was nothing shared to be consistent *with*: App.xaml merged only
    XamlControlsResources, so the same card, chip and pill were re-declared inline in AboutPage, SettingsPage
    and SessionPage, drifting a little each time.

    It is now four dictionaries rather than one, split by WHAT KIND OF DECISION each holds, because they get
    edited for different reasons and by different people:

      Tokens    values — spacing, icon sizes, radii, the vendor accents. No appearance.
      Text      the type ramp. Roles BasedOn stock styles, no sizes, no margins.
      Surfaces  the boxes, and the elevation rules about when a box is allowed to exist.
      Motion    durations and easings, aliased onto WinUI's own.
      Card      the console card's own material, and the only dictionary here with theme dictionaries.

    Order matters within the merge: Surfaces resolves radius tokens from Tokens with StaticResource, and
    StaticResource is a parse-time lookup, so a dictionary may only reference one merged before it. Order
    matters outside it too — App.xaml merges this AFTER XamlControlsResources, since Text's roles are BasedOn
    the stock text ramp.

    Pages are migrated to these keys opportunistically, and several still carry their own copies. That is
    tracked as its own piece of work rather than done here: changing every page at the same time as splitting
    the dictionary would make both diffs unreadable.
-->
<ResourceDictionary
    xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

    <ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
        <ResourceDictionary Source="ms-appx:///Styles/Ripcord.Tokens.xaml" />
        <ResourceDictionary Source="ms-appx:///Styles/Ripcord.Text.xaml" />
        <ResourceDictionary Source="ms-appx:///Styles/Ripcord.Surfaces.xaml" />
        <ResourceDictionary Source="ms-appx:///Styles/Ripcord.Motion.xaml" />
        <ResourceDictionary Source="ms-appx:///Styles/Ripcord.Card.xaml" />
    </ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>

</ResourceDictionary>
